  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In a world inundated with information and faced with complex, interconnected challenges, the pathway to accelerate the implementation of SDGs necessitates a harmonized approach that leverages both data-driven insights and improved and inclusive collaboration. This project will utilize interventions that support the acceleration of SDGs in Albania through data-driven analysis and youth inclusion, such as assistance for voluntary national or local reviews, INFF dissemination activities, and youth</narrative>
